        <p>UI/UX Design · Motion · Typography · Visual Design</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROJECTS -->
  <section id="projects" class="reveal">
    <p class="section-label code-font">// 003 — projects</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">SELECTED WORK</h2>
    <div class="projects-list">

      <div class="project-item">
        <div class="project-num code-font">01</div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <h3>Project Name One</h3>
          <p>A full stack web application built with React and Node.js. Short description of what it does and the problem it solves.</p>
          <div class="project-tags">
            <span>React</span><span>Node.js</span><span>MongoDB</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-links">
          <a href="#" class="project-link">Live ↗</a>
          <a href="#" class="project-link">GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-item">
        <div class="project-num code-font">02</div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <h3>Project Name Two</h3>
          <p>Description of the second project. What problem does it solve? What technologies did you use?</p>
          <div class="project-tags">
            <span>Astro</span><span>Tailwind</span><span>JavaScript</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-links">
          <a href="#" class="project-link">Live ↗</a>
          <a href="#" class="project-link">GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-item">
        <div class="project-num code-font">03</div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <h3>Project Name Three</h3>
          <p>Description of the third project. Keep it concise — 1 or 2 sentences that explain the core idea.</p>
          <div class="project-tags">
            <span>HTML</span><span>CSS</span><span>JavaScript</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-links">
          <a href="#" class="project-link">Live ↗</a>
          <a href="#" class="project-link">GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section id="contact" class="reveal">
    <p class="section-label code-font">// 004 — contact</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">LET'S BUILD<br/>SOMETHING</h2>
    <a href="mailto:you@email.com" class="contact-email">you@email.com</a>
    <div class="contact-socials">
      <a href="#">GitHub</a>
      <a href="#">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="#">Twitter</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-line">
      <span>© 2026 Suchintha Hettiarachchi</span>
      <a href="/">← Back to Home</a>
    </div>
